{
  "name": "static",
  "label": "Static",
  "description": "Early-2000s alt rock. A sketchbook by day: aged paper, pencil lines, condensed stencil type, red ink and photocopy grain. A spray-painted concrete wall after dark. Pages are taped up with duct tape, keys are stencilled and glitch when you hover, labels are Dymo tape, avatars are pin badges, progress is a VU meter, the spinner is an equalizer and toasts play in a Winamp-style LCD.",
  "fonts": "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Big+Shoulders+Stencil+Display:wght@700;800;900&family=Archivo+Narrow:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Special+Elite&display=swap",
